00:03:00,400 --> 00:03:22,160
So the way that might translate then into the application of AI is as things get more mechanized, as AI gets more powerful and supplants human capabilities, how do you preserve the human connection in that healthcare sort of event or activity, especially not just now but like decades from now.

28
00:03:22,480 --> 00:03:32,400
And so we wrestled with how do you define that sort of bright line boundary where human needs to be involved when computers and AI and robots will be, you know, arguably more effective.

29
00:03:33,920 --> 00:03:34,080
Right.

30
