00:07:22,880 --> 00:07:29,600
So we spend a little bit of time looking at the kind of three goals that many health systems have.

63
00:07:30,400 --> 00:07:32,480
One is to increase access to care.

64
00:07:33,280 --> 00:07:34,640
Access is a major issue.

65
