00:08:09,440 --> 00:08:15,120
So to give an example, ambient scribes are getting very popular, right?

73
00:08:15,440 --> 00:08:27,200
So when you come to the doctor, when I take my child to the pediatrician, it used to be that the poor doctor had to type in and talk to me or my child, right, multitask.

74
00:08:28,560 --> 00:08:42,800
Now there is the ambient scribe that listens to the conversation and creates the clinical note that the doctor will review afterwards, but it frees the clinician to have a face-to-face direct conversation.

75
00:08:43,600 --> 00:08:53,600
I like this example because it shows how AI is rehumanizing the interaction in the healthcare setting.

76
00:08:54,000 --> 00:08:58,480
